{"title":"Research Assistant Roadmap","role":"Research Assistant","summary":"If the B.Sc is a three-year programme, integrate the Year 4 research internship and dissertation activities into the final year.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Anthropology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"Can I build strong anthropological and research-method skills?","output":"Fieldwork + research projects + analytical portfolio"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"Can I independently support research studies?","output":"Research Assistant/Associate experience"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"Can I lead research components?","output":"Research design + publication/project leadership"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How do I remain relevant?","output":"Mixed-methods research + digital anthropology + AI/data skills"}],"sections":[{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Anthropology fundamentals"},{"text":"University coursework + textbooks"},{"text":"Structured notes"},{"text":"Subject foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Human evolution + biological anthropology"},{"text":"Lab + field exercises"},{"text":"Practical records"},{"text":"Scientific foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Social/cultural anthropology"},{"text":"Ethnographies + case studies"},{"text":"Ethnographic observation"},{"text":"Research thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Research-method courses"},{"text":"Mini research proposal"},{"text":"Research foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Statistics + qualitative analysis"},{"text":"Statistical software + research papers"},{"text":"Data-analysis project"},{"text":"Analytical capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Fieldwork + academic writing"},{"text":"Faculty/research projects"},{"text":"Fieldwork report"},{"text":"Research readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Research internship"},{"text":"University/NGO/research institute"},{"text":"Research assistantship"},{"text":"Professional readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Dissertation/publication-quality project"},{"text":"Faculty mentor"},{"text":"Complete research paper"},{"text":"Career readiness"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"If the B.Sc is a three-year programme, integrate the Year 4 research internship and dissertation activities into the final year."},{"type":"h","text":"Core technical stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Anthropology fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biological anthropology"},{"text":"Physical anthropology"},{"text":"Social anthropology"},{"text":"Cultural anthropology"},{"text":"Archaeological anthropology"},{"text":"Linguistic anthropology"},{"text":"Human evolution"},{"text":"Human variation"},{"text":"Population studies"},{"text":"Kinship"},{"text":"Marriage and family"},{"text":"Religion"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Social organisation"},{"text":"Economic anthropology"},{"text":"Political anthropology"},{"text":"Urban anthropology"},{"text":"Medical anthropology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Research methodology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research questions"},{"text":"Hypothesis development"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Research design"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Primary data"},{"text":"Secondary data"},{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Focus groups"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Participant observation"},{"text":"Ethnographic methods"},{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"Comparative research"},{"text":"Mixed-methods research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important research principle"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should learn to distinguish:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Observation","Evidence","Interpretation","Conclusion"]},{"type":"p","text":"rather than treating an observation as proof of a broader social or cultural claim."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Fieldwork"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Participant observation"},{"text":"Non-participant observation"},{"text":"Semi-structured interviews"},{"text":"Key-informant interviews"},{"text":"Focus groups"},{"text":"Household surveys"},{"text":"Field notes"},{"text":"Audio recording where consent permits"},{"text":"Photography/documentation where ethically permitted"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Coding"},{"text":"Community engagement"},{"text":"Field diaries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Quantitative analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentages"},{"text":"Cross-tabulation"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression basics"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SPSS"},{"text":"R"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Qualitative analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open coding"},{"text":"Axial coding"},{"text":"Thematic analysis"},{"text":"Narrative analysis"},{"text":"Content analysis"},{"text":"Interview coding"},{"text":"Ethnographic interpretation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NVivo"},{"text":"ATLAS.ti"},{"text":"MAXQDA"},{"text":"QualCoder"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Academic research"},{"type":"p","text":"Build competence in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature searches"},{"text":"Citation management"},{"text":"Research papers"},{"text":"Annotated bibliographies"},{"text":"Systematic literature reviews"},{"text":"Research reports"},{"text":"Academic presentations"},{"text":"Poster presentations"},{"text":"Conference abstracts"},{"text":"Research proposals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful reference-management tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Zotero"},{"text":"Mendeley"},{"text":"EndNote"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. GIS and spatial research"},{"type":"p","text":"Anthropological research increasingly benefits from spatial analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"Basic ArcGIS concepts"},{"text":"GPS/location data"},{"text":"Mapping"},{"text":"Population distribution"},{"text":"Migration mapping"},{"text":"Settlement mapping"},{"text":"Cultural landscapes"},{"text":"Spatial analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research ethics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a core professional skill, particularly when working with people and communities."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Anonymisation"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Voluntary participation"},{"text":"Vulnerable populations"},{"text":"Researcher positionality"},{"text":"Avoiding harm"},{"text":"Ethical fieldwork"},{"text":"Institutional ethics approval where applicable"},{"text":"Responsible publication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should never collect sensitive personal information simply because it is convenient for a research project."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital anthropology and AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern anthropology increasingly intersects with technology."},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital ethnography"},{"text":"Social-media research"},{"text":"Online communities"},{"text":"Human-computer interaction"},{"text":"Digital cultures"},{"text":"Computational social science"},{"text":"Text analysis"},{"text":"Network analysis"},{"text":"AI and society"},{"text":"Technology and culture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature discovery"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Coding assistance"},{"text":"Thematic organisation"},{"text":"Data exploration"},{"text":"Translation support"},{"text":"Research brainstorming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But researchers must independently verify evidence, protect confidential data and avoid uploading sensitive participant information to inappropriate AI systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Cultural Anthropology"},{"text":"Ethnography + culture"},{"text":"Fieldwork/research"},{"text":"Cultural Researcher"}],[{"text":"Biological Anthropology"},{"text":"Human biology + evolution"},{"text":"Laboratory/research"},{"text":"Biological Anthropologist"}],[{"text":"Medical Anthropology"},{"text":"Health + culture"},{"text":"Public-health research"},{"text":"Medical Anthropologist"}],[{"text":"Tribal/Indigenous Studies"},{"text":"Fieldwork + community studies"},{"text":"Field research"},{"text":"Tribal Research Specialist"}],[{"text":"Development Research"},{"text":"Anthropology + development"},{"text":"NGOs/policy institutes"},{"text":"Development Researcher"}],[{"text":"Archaeological Anthropology"},{"text":"Archaeology + material culture"},{"text":"Archaeological research"},{"text":"Archaeological Researcher"}],[{"text":"Urban Anthropology"},{"text":"Urbanisation + ethnography"},{"text":"City research"},{"text":"Urban Researcher"}],[{"text":"Digital Anthropology"},{"text":"Digital ethnography + data"},{"text":"Online research"},{"text":"Digital Anthropologist"}],[{"text":"Population Studies"},{"text":"Demography + statistics"},{"text":"Survey research"},{"text":"Population Researcher"}],[{"text":"Public Health Research"},{"text":"Health + quantitative methods"},{"text":"Research institutes"},{"text":"Public Health Researcher"}],[{"text":"Social Research"},{"text":"Mixed methods + statistics"},{"text":"Research organisations"},{